WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.682
We said we'd go for a quick ride.

00:00:01.682 --> 00:00:02.990
Just twenty minutes.

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:09.661
Somehow, that turned into a detour, a coffee stop, and a very serious debate about which pastry to get.

00:00:09.661 --> 00:00:10.841
No training plan.

00:00:10.841 --> 00:00:12.196
No personal best.

00:00:12.196 --> 00:00:16.343
Just two bikes, a sunny street, and absolutely no hurry.

00:00:16.343 --> 00:00:19.077
Honestly, the hardest part was getting out the door.

00:00:19.077 --> 00:00:23.364
So if your morning needs a reset, grab a friend and take the long way home.

00:00:23.364 --> 00:00:25.525
The coffee counts as part of the route.

